# Uninvited Guests (battlefield.uninvited_guests, Monarch Linn): the registrant's requirements (Quest[4][81]Prog 1
# and the permit). Each char triggers SD_Entrance and gets the requirements message (7150) and a release, no menu:
# main (accepted, Prog 1) has no permit; bob (accepted, Prog 0) has the permit; cat (accepted, Prog 2) has the
# permit; dan (quest not accepted, Prog 1) has the permit.
lists MonarchLinn/SD_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=MonarchLinn pos=-37.6,-3.35,-540 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=MonarchLinn pos=-37.6,-3.35,-540 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=MonarchLinn pos=-37.6,-3.35,-540 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=MonarchLinn pos=-37.6,-3.35,-540 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.UninvitedGuests accepted
charvar Quest[4][81]Prog 1
bob: quest OtherAreas.UninvitedGuests accepted
bob: charvar Quest[4][81]Prog 0
bob: keyitem MonarchLinnPatrolPermit
cat: quest OtherAreas.UninvitedGuests accepted
cat: charvar Quest[4][81]Prog 2
cat: keyitem MonarchLinnPatrolPermit
dan: charvar Quest[4][81]Prog 1
dan: keyitem MonarchLinnPatrolPermit
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
trigger SD_Entrance
bob: trigger SD_Entrance
cat: trigger SD_Entrance
dan: trigger SD_Entrance
